Address multiplies use v_mul_u32_u24 (full rate) instead of v_mul_lo_u32 (quarter rate) when value facts prove the
operands fit 24 bits: fragment-memory lane offsets and scaled terms, and memory-address scale terms. Bit-identical
results; prefill GEMM cycles -0.28% on gfx1151 (476 of 663 multiplies in the prefill set).

